  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sahel Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to promote stabilisation efforts in the MINUSMA UK deployment Area of Operation through stabilisation expertise, civilian-military coordination and small projects. It includes other stabilisation activity in central Mali, including through the MINUSMA Trust Fund, and activity to promote women&#x2019;s meaningful involvement in local stabilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
